	await novel_interface.show_text_only("The brain, to provide a reasonable explanation for an unfathomable situation, generates a series of images to convince the body that everything is fine.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Perhaps it’s an innate reflex all humans possess.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("An ancient protective mechanism against the unknown, programmed in our genes.")
	await novel_interface.hide_background()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("…")
